  level: 1
  dialogue:
  - "Hello, housekeeping. I seem to have lost my phone while doing my laundry. I
    was waiting for the machine to finish spinning, and I was just sitting there
    using my phone. But when it finished and I went to collect my clothes, I went
    back to my room and suddenly couldn\u2019t find my phone anymore. I came back
    down to look for it, but I still can\u2019t find it anywhere. Could you please
    help me look for it? I might have missed some spots\u2014maybe under the table
    or under the washing machine. Thank you in advance"
